        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> Unrelated, but note that this is very unlikely to get resolved in oil due to lack of activity (unless the core changes fix everything... hopefully).\n\nI know, and that's unfortunate.\nI've always wished oil would eventually be revived under the `nvim-<name>` plugins, as it was for `nvim-treesitter` and others.\n\n> And as justin said, please report the kernel of the issue first so we can more easily identify a fix in the future.\n\nI generally try, but for this one I did not know how to report other than saying it was broken (and showed images of the error).\n(PS: although I wish I will one day join active Nvim development, I currently really don't have enough time to start studying it to be able to contribute).\nNot that [elsewhere](https://github.com/stevearc/oil.nvim/issues/765) the reporting was that much more detailed either. But fair point regardless.\n",
